# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and in every working tree.
# Without this, contributors on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and CI/macOS
# checkouts disagree about EOLs, and `git status` fills up with
# whitespace-only "modifications" that bury real changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize, never diff.
*.ico binary
